  "details": "\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: uninitialized-heap vulnerability in function\n     tic4x_print_cond in file opcodes/tic4x-dis.c\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2020-35342.patch: Init all of condtable\n     - CVE-2020-35342\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: a memory consumption issue in get_data function in\n     binutils/nm.c\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2020-19724.patch: Free dyn_syms\n     - CVE-2020-19724\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: a memory leak when process microblaze-dis.c\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2020-21490.patch: Use strbuf rather than strdup\n       of local temp\n     - CVE-2020-21490\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: an issue relating to the auxiliary symbol data allows\n     attackers to read or write to system memory or cause a denial of\n     service\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2020-19726.patch: Fix parsing a corrupt PE format\n       file\n     - CVE-2020-19726",
